    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110-a3">

                <pb facs="0165" n="159" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg159"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shiakwan</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Peking:</hi></p>
                <p>Viceroy begs me to ask you urge all the powers to reduce indemnity and accept
                    installment plan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Martin.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
